      <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Our Story</p>
      <p>Kumawat Plumbing &amp; Electricals started with a single set of toolbags and a focus on serving local residents on Station Road, Govindgarh. Over the last 12 years, our reputation has grown purely from recommendations and trust. We believe in providing solutions, not excuses.</p>
      <p>Whether you are dealing with a faulty geyser thermostat, low water pressure, a short circuit in your distribution panel, or you simply need quality replacement fittings delivered to your doorstep, Himanshu Kumawat and his assistant Deepak ensure high-quality workmanship.</p>
      <p>We do not outsource or hire unverified day laborers. When you hire Kumawat P&amp;E, you get expert technicians who know the systems inside out, tidy up after completion, and stand by their work with a 30-day labor guarantee.</p>
      
